    "en": [
      "This is an old, sepia-toned postcard showing a panoramic view of a coastal cityscape with several small boats floating in the water in the foreground. The city is densely built-up and extends up a hillside. There is handwritten text in Spanish on the lower part of the postcard. Printed text reads 'VIGO VISTA GENERAL', indicating this is a general view of Vigo."
